                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="about-mission-card-text">
                    <h3 class="about-card-title">Concrete enough to act on</h3>
                    <p class="about-card-text">Each recommendation comes with owners, first steps and dates your team can start on.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="about-mission-card">
                  <div class="about-mission-number">03</div>
